==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|sympathetick}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌsɪmpəˈθɛtɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-us-sympathetic.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛtɪk|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, related to, showing, or [[characterize]]d by [[sympathy]].
#: ''John looked very upset. I gave him a '''sympathetic''' look.''
# Relating to [[similarity]].
#: '''''Sympathetic''' magic is based on imitation or correspondence.''
# {{lb|en|physiology}} Relating to the [[sympathetic nervous system]].
#: '''''Sympathetic''' innervation involves epinephrine.''
# Relating to sounds induced by vibrations conveyed through a fluid from a body already in vibration.

